{"title": "[花邊] Ja:在阿拓打球好開心 空檔多了 守的少了", "author": "pneumo (超☆冒險蓋)", "board": "", "date": "Wed Oct 28 14:47:47 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1793170069.A.A4B.html", "body": "來源：NBA on NBC\n網址：\nhttps://x.com/NBAonNBC/status/2115326795109015560\n\nJa Morant discusses the clutch win and what it's like playing with his new\nPortland teammates!\n\nJa Morant講到今天的關鍵勝利以及跟他的阿拓隊友打球的感覺。\n\n影片\n：\nhttps://streamable.com/svigwm\n\n逐字稿\n\nReporter: \"What did this win come down to in clutch time?\"\n\n記者：「這場比賽在關鍵時刻能贏球的原因是什麼？」\n\n\"Our message to each other the whole game was the first team to, you know,\nlock in on defense to win the game. And obviously, you know, coming in out of\nthe half down five, not playing how we want to, we had to, you know, take a\nstep in that direction. Third quarter wasn't pretty, but, you know, we got it\ndone in the fourth, and, you know, that's all that matters.\"\n\n「我們整場給彼此的訊息就是，誰先在防守上專注就可以拿下比賽。」\n\n「在半場的時候我們還落後5分，打的沒有我們想要的好，所以我們得往那方向邁進。」\n\n「第三節也沒有打得很好，但是我們在第四節完成任務，那就是最重要的。」\n\nReporter: \"I saw you doing Dame Time out here. You, Damian, Deni, I mean, the\nlist goes on and on. What excites you most about playing with this group?\"\n\n記者：「我剛剛看到你做了小李比手表的手勢。你，小李，Deni...這名單很長。跟這群\n\n球員一起打球，你覺得最興奮的是什麼？」\n\n\"Uh, it's just so much fun. Uh, so many guys that can do a lot. Uh, easier\nlooks. Uh, easier coverages for me. Uh, it's a blessing to, you know, be able\nto play around, you know, one of the best shooters of all time, and then a\ntalent like Deni as well, and the rest of the guys. Uh, we just got to\ncontinue to, you know, gel together, keep the chemistry going, and keep going\nand doing what we're doing, you know.\"\n\n「真的非常有樂趣，很多隊友可以做很多事情，讓我有更好的空檔，更簡單的防守。」\n\n「跟有歷史最佳射手之一，有像Deni這樣有天賦的球員，以及其他隊友們一起打球，真\n\n的非常幸運。」\n\n「我們只要繼續下去，繼續磨合，保持團隊默契，繼續做我們現在做的。」\n\nReporter: \"It's a small sample size, but you guys remain undefeated. So, what\nelse do you attribute just this early success to as a whole?\"\n\n記者：「雖然樣本數不多，但是你們目前保持不敗，你認為這初期的成功可以歸因於什\n\n麼部分呢？」\n\n\"Um, I'll say determination. You know, we are a very determined team. We know\nwhat we want, we know what we want to accomplish, and I just feel like we\nwon't be satisfied when, when we're not good enough. So, obviously, you know,\nthis game was not as pretty, the last one wasn't as pretty, uh, but we still\ngot the win. That's something to be happy about, but we know we got a lot of\nstuff to fix.\"\n\n「我會說是決心，我們是一支非常有決心的隊伍。我們知道我們想要什麼，我們知道我們\n\n想要達成什麼。」\n\n「我只是覺得，當我們還不夠好的時候，我們就不會感到滿足。很明顯的，就像今天晚上\n\n打得並不漂亮，上一場也是，但是我們贏了。」\n\n「儘管這可以讓我們感到開心，但是我們知道我們還有很多東西得要修正。」\n\n----\n\n開心的Ja", "comments": [{"tag": "→", "user": "alittleghost", "content": "所以之前誰讓你不開心", "time": "10/28 14:48"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hws606", "content": "Bane跟JJJ不好嗎", "time": "10/28 14:49"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "a28200266", "content": "之前為什麼不開心", "time": "10/28 14:49"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "fish0112", "content": "其實灰熊也不差 雙贏？", "time": "10/28 14:49"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "liqqq1108", "content": "贏球治百病", "time": "10/28 14:49"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "eric20601", "content": "之前不是跟教練嗎", "time": "10/28 14:49"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "bm1041644", "content": "你前隊友是DPOY餒 在臭嗎可惡", "time": "10/28 14:50"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hua0122", "content": "有人幫吸怪 好開心", "time": "10/28 14:50"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "a28200266", "content": "不過之前那個不擋拆打法確實很失敗就是了", "time": "10/28 14:50"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "benson1212", "content": "在灰熊明顯超級不開心吧 不需要影射都知道", "time": "10/28 14:50"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "loverxa", "content": "最後吃AR吃的好開心", "time": "10/28 14:50"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "conqueror507", "content": "會講話，給過", "time": "10/28 14:50"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "jeff1013", "content": "應該不是臭前隊友", "time": "10/28 14:51"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "vince4687", "content": "更簡單的防守真的假的啊 那阿拓先發都靠三個人在守", "time": "10/28 14:51"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "vince4687", "content": "喔", "time": "10/28 14:51"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "gm79227922", "content": "現在是阿拓正排1號控球了", "time": "10/28 14:51"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "madaofreak", "conten